flowchart TD
  A[ARRIVED] --> V{Needs ventilator?}
  V -->|yes| WV[WAIT_VENT] --> ACQ[Acquire ventilator]
  V -->|no| WR[WAIT_RES]
  ACQ --> WR
  WR --> B{Banker grants?}
  B -->|no: sleep 50 ms| WR
  B -->|yes| R[READY]
  R --> G[Wait on go]
  G --> U[RUN one unit]
  U --> Z{Remaining zero?}
  Z -->|yes| REL[Release resources and ventilator] --> DONE[DONE]
  Z -->|no| Q{Second request point?}
  Q -->|yes: signal done first| WR
  Q -->|no| R
